# API standards

Imported by backend_CLAUDE.md.example - demonstrates @import pulling in a
standards file scoped to one package, rather than bloating the root CLAUDE.md
with rules only the API team needs.

- Every endpoint validates input before touching the database.
- Error responses use the shared {errorCategory, isRetryable, message} shape
  from domain_2_tool_design_mcp/task_2_2_structured_error_responses.py.
